## Troubleshooting

### Common Issues

#### Permission Denied (Network Monitoring)
```bash
# Solution: Run with elevated privileges
sudo ucg-cert-monitor monitor

# Or give capabilities (Linux)
sudo setcap cap_net_raw,cap_net_admin=eip $(which python3)
```

#### UCG Authentication Failed
```bash
# Check credentials
ucg-cert-monitor discover

# Verify UCG API endpoints are accessible
curl -k https://192.168.1.1/api/status
```

#### No Certificates Detected
```bash
# Test passive collection first
ucg-cert-monitor collect --host google.com --port 443

# Check network interface
ip link show  # Linux
ifconfig      # macOS
```

